 expression or assignment, a few separators cannot be used when these commands
-are abbreviated to a single character: ':', '-' and '.'. >
-	g:pattern:cmd	  # invalid command - ERROR
-	s:pattern:repl	  # invalid command - ERROR
-	g-pattern-cmd	  # invalid command - ERROR
