+							*:++* *:--*
+- The ++ and -- commands have been added.  They add and subtract one
+  respectively.  They work with number and float types.  For example:
+>vim9
+	vim9script
+	var flo: float = 41.0
+	++flo
+	echo flo	# 42.0
